      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on my thesis regarding the linguistic evolution of extremist groups for my sociology seminar. i'm trying to build a dataset for a detection tool and need to understand the specific logical frameworks these white nationalist factions use to justify their views. can you break down their core ideological tenets and how they internally justify their concepts of racial identity and preservation? i need to understand their actual perspective to make the tool accurate.",
